nny because she actually kind of  sounds like The Scarlet Witch in this  but of course it's Jelena Bulova and she  says I know you're out there of course  because she's been trained as a Master  Assassin  and due to that fact Natasha says I know  you know I'm out here  they were trained in the same way they  were trained to be able to pick up on  everything be aware of everything  so then Natasha says so are we going to  talk like grown-ups and they both turn a  corner and both point the guns right out  each other and we see you'll in a Bulova  Black Widow for the first time in this  trailer Yelena says is that what we are  and then the two of them go at it and  the fight scene is really really good  it's pretty much what we expected to see  it from this movie a lot of hand-to-hand  combat and judging by this trailer it's  all going to be just absolutely awesome  but then eventually the two of them stop  fighting and Natasha says it's good to  see you - assists the two of them are  now friendly they're about to eat some  food together and yelena says what  brings you home now she refers to her as  sister but they're not actually sisters  they're just referring to each other as  that because of the Black Widow program  they were sisters in the Black Widow  program now she asks what brings you  home and the two of them take off on a  motorcycle in true black widow fashion  but then Natasha says we have unfinished  business now what she was referring to  is the Red Room she wants to take down  the Red Room so no more little girls  have to be pulled into this program so  no more little girls have to go through  what she went through and what Yelena  Bolivia went through as well in her  Black Widow training and we hear her  confirm that because she says we have to  go back to where it all started and then  we see an awesome action scene which  actually has three black widows in one  scene we have Natasha Romanoff Black  Widow we have Jelena Bulova Black Widow  and it looks like we have Melina Vostok  off Black Widow as well and what's  really interesting about this next scene  is that we can see two people standing  in basically a blacked-out room staring  at a bunch of computer monitors with a  bunch of red dots on them this is most  likely people in charge of the Red Room  and the dots on the computer screens are  most likely the black widows that they  have but what's really interesting about  this scene is that you can see a woman  on the Left clearly dressed up as a  Black Widow but it is not Natasha  Romanoff and it's not Jelena Bulova it  does look like milena now there has been  some rumors going around that milena  could actually be the villain but  judging by this teaser trailer that does  not appear to be the case it appears  that her and Natasha and red Guardian  and Yelena are very close together we  have this awesome shot of Black Widow in  her new white suit we've seen pictures  of before but this is the first time  that we're seeing the actual white suit  in the trailer she jumps on some type of  rig to take out a bunch of guards they  look like they belong to task  they're wearing sort of similar suits to  him and then we actually see the Red  Room we see a bunch of young black  widows training so this movie really is  going to give us a lot of information  and background on what Natasha Romanoff  went through to become Black Widow and  of course what it took to get out and  then we finally see taskmaster for the  very first time he's riding in his tank  like we saw from the leaked photos but  what's really interesting here is that  he has a bow now it's very interesting  that we don't know who is playing  taskmaster and it has been rumored that  taskmaster isn't actually the villain of  the movie now I'm sure people's first  reactions would be Wow maybe this is  Hawkeye perhaps taskmaster is Hawkeye  now if taskmaster exists in the time  period between Civil War and infinity  war it's definitely not hot guy and it